# Colocated sub-apps (coinchapp, tranquil): each is a self-governing project
# with its own package.json, lint, and format tooling — see docs/GAMES_MAP.md.
# Formatting them with this repo's Prettier config would rewrite hundreds of
# files that were never meant to follow it.
