# Protocol and living documents: hand-written prose and tables. DECISIONS.md is
# append-only, so table realignment would rewrite past entries for no gain.
**/*.md

# Game content, not code: question banks and wordpacks.
# Reformatting these produced ~500k changed lines for zero readability gain.
public/data/**/*_words.json
public/data/olemains/words.json

